  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>AURA</strong> moderate divination; <strong>CL</strong> 3rd <strong>SLOT</strong> —; <strong>PRICE</strong> 500 gp; <strong>WEIGHT</strong> 3 lbs.</p>\n<p><strong>DESCRIPTION</strong><br>\nA book that, when opened to a blank page in the presence of another creature who the owner of the book desires, an illustration of that creature in a suggestive pose is quickly and magically sketched on the page. If multiple creatures are in the room, they are all illustrated in a single image. The book uses only the information in the imagination of the owner of the book and does not reveal any particular information that they don’t imagine. The style of the image is artistic and embellishments may be made, though is typically accurate enough to distinguish the identity of the individual pictured. A standard book has 50 pages. Once an image has been created, it cannot be erased or destroyed without destroying the page itself.</p>\n<p><strong>CONSTRUCTION REQUIREMENTS</strong><br>\nCraft Wondrous Item, unnatural lust<sup>UM</sup>; <strong>COST</strong> 250 gp</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/gonzo-wondrous-items#toc0\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
